# Data artifacts
*.parquet
data/interim/
data/processed/
forecasts/
models/*.pkl

# Serialized model artifacts are regenerable from the raw CSV by
#   python -m src.evaluation.run_statistical
# and are excluded for the same reason data/interim, data/processed and
# forecasts are: they are outputs, not sources. A single SARIMAX result is
# ~3.5 MB even after slimming. Provenance (raw-CSV and master-series hashes)
# is embedded in each artifact so a regenerated file is traceable.
